  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposal would, due to its inappropriate form, scale, design, and roof style, result in a bulky and incongruous addition to the site, which would unbalance the appearance of the row of terraced houses, harmful to the character and appearance of the street scene, contrary to Local Plan policies CC1 (Context and Character) and CC2 (Urban Design and Architecture).",
    "Reason : 2 - The proposal would, due to insufficient information to demonstrate otherwise, fail to demonstrate that the development would maximise energy savings at each step of the energy hierarchy and therefore make the fullest contribution to minimising carbon dioxide emissions, contrary to Local Plan policies EQ1 (Energy and Carbon Reduction) and EQ2 (Sustainable Design and Construction) and London Plan Policies SI2 (Minimising Greenhouse Gas Emissions)."
